 "level_notes": {
  "0": "red/red: the toolchain (red.r, system/compiler.r) is still written in Rebol 2; the runtime is in Red/System (runtime/*.reds) and the standard environment in Red (environment/*.red).",
  "1": "No specification for Red itself beyond the red/docs reference (datatypes, PARSE, VID, reactivity); Red/System has a written specification. Many Rebol 2 documents still apply.",
  "3": "Rosetta Code reports 'blocked' to automated checkers."
